<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39275" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιδίφρι-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>on the car</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ὅ κε δῶρα φέρων ἐπιδίφρια θήῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					15.51
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				75
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. <i>one who
				sits at his work, plies a sedentary</i> or <i>humble
			trade</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Th.</u>
				50
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				5.1708.21
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Just.
				<u>Nov.</u>
				90.1
			</span></i>
			<u>Intr.</u>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τεχνίτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>VP</u>
					34.245
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη ἐ</span>. <i>a
			sedentary</i> trade, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				2.28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐργασία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Artem.
					2.14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
			Adj., <i>belonging to daily life</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέξις</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολιτική, δημηγορική</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.199S.
			</span></i></div>
